.TH MYUTILS 3 "September 2026" "Version 1.0" "Custom Utility Library Manual"
.SH NAME
myutils \- custom string and file utility functions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.sp
.I int
.B my_strlen(const char *str);
.sp
.I void
.B my_strcpy(char *dest, const char *src);
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B myutils
is a custom utility library developed for operating systems assignments to demonstrate multi-file compilation, static linking, and dynamic linking.
.PP
.B my_strlen
calculates the length of the string pointed to by
.I str
(excluding the terminating null byte).
.PP
.B my_strcpy
copies the string pointed to by
.I src
to the buffer pointed to by
.I dest
including the terminating null byte.
